# Beast 3.0 Analytics & Telemetry Division

The Analytics & Telemetry Division provides continuous monitoring, data aggregation, and operational intelligence across all 21 divisions of the Beast 3.0 ecosystem.

## Mission

Deliver actionable, real-time insights into network throughput, resource allocation efficiency, system latency, and overall ecosystem health.

## Core Responsibilities

- Real-Time Event & Metric Collection
- Infrastructure & Contract Latency Monitoring
- Resource Disbursement Analytics
- Custom Telemetry Pipelines & Reporting Dashboards

## Connected Systems

- Core Control Plane (`div-21-system-orchestrator`)
- Treasury & Revenue Division (`beast3-treasury-revenue`)
- Resource Allocation Division (`div-06-resource-alloc`)
- Cyber Security & Defense Division (`div-07-security-firewall`)

## Status

Development
